	(text "Firmware (ADSBee) after each cold start without backup:\nCFG-I2C-ENABLED 0, CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_SHORTDET 1, CFG-HW-ANT_SUP_SHORT_PIN 3,\nCFG-HW-ANT_CFG_OPENDET 1, CFG-HW-ANT_SUP_OPEN_PIN 2, CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_PWRDOWN 1, CFG-HW-ANT_CFG_RECOVER 1.\nOpen detect: about 1.8 mA through R82. SW5 off: passive antenna, reported as open."
